- normal: Serverless Standard Edition

For more information, see [Billing](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/84737.html).', example='professional', position='Query'),
  topicQuota?: int32(name='TopicQuota', description='The number of topics. We do not recommend that you specify this parameter.

- You must specify either the number of partitions or the topic specification. We recommend that you specify only the number of partitions.

